egin="0:43.227" end="0:43.586">好</span><span begin="0:43.586" end="0:44.023">烦</span> <span begin="0:44.023" end="0:44.966">接近理想</span><span begin="0:44.966" end="0:45.345">好</span><span begin="0:45.345" end="0:45.742">难</span></p><p begin="0:45.742" end="0:49.385" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:45.742" end="0:46.016">却</span><span begin="0:46.016" end="0:46.732">又还很</span><span begin="0:46.732" end="0:47.486">不甘</span> <span begin="0:47.486" end="0:48.404">如何拥抱</span><span begin="0:48.404" end="0:49.385">平淡</span></p><p begin="0:50.099" end="0:55.389" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:50.099" end="0:50.882">如果</span> <span begin="0:50.882" end="0:51.818">最难得到</span><span begin="0:51.818" end="0:52.738">圆满</span> <span begin="0:52.738" end="0:53.047">不如</span><span begin="0:53.047" end="0:53.536">选择</span><span begin="0:53.536" end="0:53.969">坦</span><span begin="0:53.969" end="0:55.389">然</span></p></div><div begin="0:55.921" end="1:23.188" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0:55.921" end="1:02.731" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.921" end="0:57.020">若是</span><span begin="0:57.020" end="0:57.790">月亮</span><span begin="0:57.790" end="0:58.270">还</span><span begin="0:58.270" end="0:58.581">没</span><span begin="0:58.581" end="0:59.191">来</span> <span begin="0:59.579" end="0:59.999">路</span><span begin="0:59.999" end="1:00.291">灯</span><span begin="1:00.291" end="1:01.711">也可照</span><span begin="1:01.711" end="1:02.108">窗</span><span begin="1:02.108" end="1:02.731">台</span></p><p begin="1:02.985" end="1:08.636" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.985" end="1:04.174">照着白</span><span begin="1:04.174" end="1:04.703">色</span><span begin="1:04.703" end="1:05.043">的</span><span begin="1:05.043" end="1:07.224">山茶花微微</span><span begin="1:07.224" end="1:08.636">开</span></p><p begin="1:09.749" end="1:16.460" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:09.749" end="1:12.410">若是晨风还没</span><span begin="1:12.410" end="1:12.960">来</span> <span begin="1:13.270" end="1:14.908">晚风也可</span><span begin="1:14.908" end="1:15.429">吹</span><span begin="1:15.429" end="1:15.808">入</span><span begin="1:15.808" end="1:16.460">怀</span></p><p begin="1:16.697" end="1:23.188" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:16.697" end="1:18.448">吹着那一</span><span begin="1:18.448" end="1:18.728">地</span><span begin="1:18.728" end="1:19.268">树</span><span begin="1:19.268" end="1:20.029">影温</span><span begin="1:20.029" end="1:20.578">柔</span><span begin="1:20.578" end="1:20.999">摇</span><span begin="1:20.999" end="1:23.188">摆</span></p></div><div begin="1:23.980" end="2:48.238" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:23.980" end="1:27.321" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:23.980" end="1:25.579">若是月亮还没来</span> <span begin="1:25.720" end="1:26.469">我们自己</span><span begin="1:26.469" end="1:26.978">造光</span><span begin="1:26.978" end="1:27.321">彩</span></p><p begin="1:27.321" end="1:30.547" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:27.321" end="1:27.549">造</span><span begin="1:27.549" end="1:28.622">一座坚守初心的</span><span begin="1:28.622" end="1:29.074">彩虹</span> <span begin="1:29.074" end="1:29.756">照亮来</span><span begin="1:29.756" end="1:30.118">时的</span><span begin="1:30.118" end="1:30.547">路牌</span></p><p begin="1:30.656" end="1:34.210" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:30.656" end="1:32.213">桥下有即将要出发的</span><span begin="1:32.213" end="1:32.395">热</span><span begin="1:32.395" end="1:32.687">烈</span> <span begin="1:32.836" end="1:33.376">又咬紧了</span><span begin="1:33.376" end="1:33.796">牙关的</span><span begin="1:33.796" end="1:34.046">岁</span><span begin="1:34.046" end="1:34.210">月</span></p><p begin="1:34.210" end="1:37.545" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:34.210" end="1:34.639">奔跑在</span><span begin="1:34.639" end="1:35.082">向光</span><span begin="1:35.082" end="1:35.514">而行的</span><span begin="1:35.514" end="1:36.031">追逐里</span> <span begin="1:36.220" end="1:36.517">我首</span><span begin="1:36.517" end="1:36.667">先</span><span begin="1:36.667" end="1:37.419">要对自己致</span><span begin="1:37.419" end="1:37.545">谢</span></p><p begin="1:37.545" end="1:41.188" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:37.545" end="1:38.107">感谢</span><span begin="1:38.107" end="1:38.417">那个</span><span begin="1:38.417" end="1:38.766">我</span> <span begin="1:38.766" end="1:38.976">路灯</span><span begin="1:38.976" end="1:39.207">下</span><span begin="1:39.207" end="1:39.487">的我</span> <span begin="1:39.588" end="1:39.767">曾</span><span begin="1:39.767" end="1:40.046">经拼不</span><span begin="1:40.046" end="1:40.438">到车</span><span begin="1:40.438" end="1:40.685">而骑回</span><span begin="1:40.685" end="1:40.988">家的</span><span begin="1:40.988" end="1:41.188">我</span></p><p begin="1:41.367" end="1:44.674" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:41.367" end="1:41.577">二手</span><span begin="1:41.577" end="1:41.966">电瓶和</span><span begin="1:41.966" end="1:42.389">生了锈的</span><span begin="1:42.389" end="1:42.616">刹</span><span begin="1:42.616" end="1:42.927">车锁</span> <span begin="1:43.088" end="1:43.758">正陪我抬头</span><span begin="1:43.758" end="1:44.429">望向万家灯</span><span begin="1:44.429" end="1:44.674">火</span></p><p begin="1:44.674" end="1:48.059" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:44.674" end="1:45.057">远处</span><span begin="1:45.057" end="1:45.677">高楼通</span><span begin="1:45.677" end="1:45.947">明的</span><span begin="1:45.947" end="1:46.218">落地</span><span begin="1:46.218" end="1:46.475">窗</span> <span begin="1:46.475" end="1:46.708">是否</span><span begin="1:46.708" end="1:47.226">仍在</span><span begin="1:47.226" end="1:47.547">等我</span><span begin="1:47.547" end="1:48.059">还愿</span></p><p begin="1:48.217" end="1:51.361" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:48.217" end="1:48.817">那些未竟的</span><span begin="1:48.817" end="1:49.249">野心和</span><span begin="1:49.249" end="1:49.701">梦想</span> <span begin="1:49.701" end="1:51.361">正如待膨胀的神券</span></p><p begin="1:51.361" end="1:55.063" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:51.361" end="1:51.608">所</span><span begin="1:51.608" end="1:51.769">以</span><span begin="1:51.769" end="1:52.130">下个</span><span begin="1:52.130" end="1:52.318">我</span> <span begin="1:52.441" end="1:52.668">再长</span><span begin="1:52.668" end="1:52.959">大的</span><span begin="1:52.959" end="1:53.240">我</span> <span begin="1:53.379" end="1:54.198">未来蓝图里肆意</span><span begin="1:54.198" end="1:54.607">绘画</span><span begin="1:54.607" end="1:54.727">的</span><span begin="1:54.727" end="1:55.063">我</span></p><p begin="1:55.063" end="1:58.447" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:55.063" end="1:56.170">不被理解到铸辉煌的</span><span begin="1:56.170" end="1:56.659">Pablo</span> <span begin="1:56.659" end="1:57.535">困难让我强大</span> <span begin="1:57.535" end="1:57.830">没法</span><span begin="1:57.830" end="1:58.082">杀</span><span begin="1:58.082" end="1:58.447">了我</span></p><p begin="1:58.447" end="2:01.649" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:58.447" end="1:59.486">总有肩并肩的</span><span begin="1:59.486" end="2:00.100">行人</span> <span begin="2:00.100" end="2:00.407">说</span><span begin="2:00.407" end="2:01.518">我们都一样</span><span begin="2:01.518" end="2:01.649">的</span></p><p begin="2:01.767" end="2:05.140" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="2:01.767" end="2:03.479">总有盏灯在凌晨</span> <span begin="2:03.629" end="2:05.140">为晚归的人亮着</span></p><p begin="2:05.301" end="2:08.717" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="2:05.301" end="2:05.430">把</span><span begin="2:05.430" end="2:05.730">所</span><span begin="2:05.730" end="2:06.369">有温暖的</span><span begin="2:06.369" end="2:06.899">力量</span><span begin="2:06.899" end="2:07.125">卷入</span> <span begin="2:07.125" end="2:07.240">那</span><span begin="2:07.240" end="2:07.542">向</span><span begin="2:07.542" end="2:08.397">光而行的热忱</span><span begin="2:08.397" end="2:08.717">里</span></p><p begin="2:08.717" end="2:12.060" itunes:key="